      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Upload a front photo in **Front** and a close-up in **Detail**.\n3. In **Chat: Attach Document**, choose the spec sheet: a PDF or text file in ComfyUI's input folder.\n4. Press **Run**. The listing is saved as JSON under `listings/approved` or `listings/review`.\n\n**Request Options** keeps the listing away from providers that store or train on requests. Three paid requests per run. Prices are in **OpenRouter models**; each request's charge is at openrouter.ai/activity."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
