        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Jev compares the listing with the spec facts and answers two questions: **supported** asks whether every claim is backed, and **persuasive** scores the copy.\n\nThe listing is saved in the **approved** folder when every claim is supported, and in **review** otherwise. One paid request."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
